\label{tab:boundary}
\begin{tabularx}{\textwidth}{l Y Y Y}
\toprule
Target & Hypothesis & Required observation & Current interpretation \\
\midrule
Forked-daapd & Overestimation: IPSM growth without downstream code gain. & Growing IPSM structure with low episode code reward. & Prior endpoint code regression not reproduced. \\
Lighttpd1 & Underestimation: code progress within shallow response states. & Code-branch gain with little IPSM gain, linked to executions. & Both endpoints increase; hidden productivity remains unverified. \\
LightFTP & Saturation: IPSM novelty after code progress plateaus. & Aligned code/IPSM trajectories across saturation. & Near-equal endpoints; matched-version trajectories still needed. \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabularx}
\end{table*}

