Pure-FTPd & FTP & 10122d9f & tcp/21 & in-ftp; ftp.dict; clean script \\
Exim & SMTP & d6a5a05b84 & tcp/25 & in-smtp; smtp.dict; clean script \\
Live555 & RTSP & live.2023.05.10 & tcp/8554 & in-rtsp; rtsp.dict; no reset script recorded \\
