Parameter & Prespecified value & Comparability requirement \\
\midrule
Model, version, and inference service & codex-auto-review via cctq.ai chat-completions endpoint & Identical resolved version; name alone insufficient. \\
Temperature by call class & grammar 0.5; plateau 1.2 & Match each call class across arms. \\
Top-$p$ / presence and frequency penalties & top-$p$ 1.0; penalties unrecorded & Explicit values or documented defaults. \\
Maximum output tokens per attempt & 4,096 & Shared limit; include truncated/failed responses. \\
Maximum attempted calls / total tokens & call cap 64; token cap 0 (unset) & Count all call classes and retries. \\
